                <title><![CDATA[【Cinema Center】MOVIE - Toy Story Saga Blu-ray Remux 1080p/2160p]]></title>
                <link><![CDATA[https://sharemania.us/threads/toy-story-saga-blu-ray-remux-1080p-2160p.296925/]]></link>
                <description><![CDATA[<article>
				<blockquote class="messageText SelectQuoteContainer ugc baseHtml">
					
					<b><i><span style="font-family: 'Book Antiqua'">The Toy Story Saga</span></i></b><br>
<br>
<b><i><span style="font-family: 'Courier New'">Pixar and Disney’s hit Toy Story saga consists of four main films released between 1995 and 2019, with a fifth installment confirmed for 2026. The franchise follows the adventures of Woody, Buzz Lightyear, and their toy friends, exploring themes of friendship and growing up. It also includes the spin-off Lightyear (2022) and several shorts.</span></i></b><br>
<br>
<b><i><span style="font-family: 'Book Antiqua'">Main Toy Story Films</span></i></b><br>
<br>
<b><i><span style="font-family: 'Courier New'">Toy Story (1995)</span></i></b>: <b><i><span style="font-family: 'Book Antiqua'">Introduces Woody, a cowboy, and the arrival of the space ranger Buzz Lightyear.<br>
<br>
<img src="https://images.static-bluray.com/movies/covers/6641_front.jpg" class="bbCodeImage LbImage" alt="[​IMG]" data-url="https://images.static-bluray.com/movies/covers/6641_front.jpg" style=""> <br>
<br>
<img src="https://images.static-bluray.com/movies/covers/239498_front.jpg" class="bbCodeImage LbImage" alt="[​IMG]" data-url="https://images.static-bluray.com/movies/covers/239498_front.jpg" style=""> </span></i></b><br>
<br>
<b><i><span style="font-family: 'Courier New'">Toy Story 2 (1999):</span></i></b> <b><i><span style="font-family: 'Book Antiqua'">Woody is kidnapped by a collector, and his friends set out on a mission to rescue him.<br>
<br>
<img src="https://images.static-bluray.com/movies/covers/6642_front.jpg" class="bbCodeImage LbImage" alt="[​IMG]" data-url="https://images.static-bluray.com/movies/covers/6642_front.jpg" style=""> <br>
<br>
<img src="https://images.static-bluray.com/movies/covers/239499_front.jpg" class="bbCodeImage LbImage" alt="[​IMG]" data-url="https://images.static-bluray.com/movies/covers/239499_front.jpg" style=""> </span></i></b><br>
<br>
<b><i><span style="font-family: 'Courier New'">Toy Story 3 (2010):</span></i></b> <b><i><span style="font-family: 'Book Antiqua'">The toys end up in a daycare center after Andy leaves for college.</span></i></b><br>
<br>
<img src="https://images.static-bluray.com/movies/covers/14836_front.jpg" class="bbCodeImage LbImage" alt="[​IMG]" data-url="https://images.static-bluray.com/movies/covers/14836_front.jpg" style=""> <br>
<br>
<img src="https://images.static-bluray.com/movies/covers/239500_front.jpg" class="bbCodeImage LbImage" alt="[​IMG]" data-url="https://images.static-bluray.com/movies/covers/239500_front.jpg" style=""> <br>
<br>
<img src="https://images.static-bluray.com/movies/covers/14836_front.jpg" class="bbCodeImage LbImage" alt="[​IMG]" data-url="https://images.static-bluray.com/movies/covers/14836_front.jpg" style=""> <br>
<br>
<img src="https://images.static-bluray.com/movies/covers/239500_front.jpg" class="bbCodeImage LbImage" alt="[​IMG]" data-url="https://images.static-bluray.com/movies/covers/239500_front.jpg" style=""> <br>
<br>
<b><i><span style="font-family: 'Courier New'">Toy Story 4 (2019):</span></i></b> <b><i><span style="font-family: 'Book Antiqua'">Woody embarks on a new life with Bo Peep, moving on from his life with human owners.<br>
<br>
<img src="https://images.static-bluray.com/movies/covers/169941_front.jpg" class="bbCodeImage LbImage" alt="[​IMG]" data-url="https://images.static-bluray.com/movies/covers/169941_front.jpg" style=""> <br>
<br>
<img src="https://images.static-bluray.com/movies/covers/241710_front.jpg" class="bbCodeImage LbImage" alt="[​IMG]" data-url="https://images.static-bluray.com/movies/covers/241710_front.jpg" style=""> </span></i></b><br>
<br>
<b><i><span style="font-family: 'Courier New'">Toy Story 5 (2026):</span></i></b> <b><i><span style="font-family: 'Book Antiqua'">Confirmed upcoming release.</span></i></b><br>
<br>
<span style="font-family: 'Book Antiqua'"><b><i>Additional Content</i></b></span><br>
<br>
<b><i><span style="font-family: 'Courier New'">Lightyear (2022):</span></i></b> <b><i><span style="font-family: 'Book Antiqua'">A spin-off film based on the "real-life" human hero who inspired the Buzz Lightyear toy.</span></i></b><br>
<br>
<b><i><span style="font-family: 'Courier New'">Specials and Shorts:</span></i></b> <b><i><span style="font-family: 'Book Antiqua'">Includes Toy Story of Terror!, Toy Story That Time Forgot, and shorts like Hawaiian Vacation.<br>
<br>
<img src="https://images.static-bluray.com/movies/covers/121004_front.jpg" class="bbCodeImage LbImage" alt="[​IMG]" data-url="https://images.static-bluray.com/movies/covers/121004_front.jpg" style=""> <br>
<br>
<img src="https://images.static-bluray.com/movies/covers/104015_front.jpg" class="bbCodeImage LbImage" alt="[​IMG]" data-url="https://images.static-bluray.com/movies/covers/104015_front.jpg" style=""> </span></i></b><br>
<br>
<b><i><span style="font-family: 'Courier New'">Fun Fact: </span><span style="font-family: 'Book Antiqua'">The main films have been critically and commercially acclaimed, with Toy Story 4 eventually surpassing the box office records set by the third installment.</span></i></b>
					<div class="messageTextEndMarker">&nbsp;</div>
				</blockquote>
			</article>]]></description>
